	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">En tandem libros, quos a me iam olim petiisti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Fidelis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tabellarius in causa fuit, quod non miserim; reliquos autem, nempe <persName ref="p3088">Sturmii</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>recipies, quum ex nundinis <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratensibus</placeName> ad nos venerint.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Confutatio <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>anabaptisticę hęreseos non extat; libros tales omnes distraxit bibliopola, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nec in Cantica canticorum <placeName>Titelmanni</placeName> extat, neque <persName ref="p7091">Wicelium</persName> amplius rep<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>erio <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>de eucharistia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p7091">Wicelii</persName> liber de traditione apostolica etiam est in quarto; quem si cupis, mittam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Aucta est confutatio contra <placeName ref="l572">Wirtembeergenses</placeName> pro Interim, libellus plenus blasphemi<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>is.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Belli sacri historiam nolo nunc temporis mittere; nam adduntur quędam; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>illis autem perfectis tuum erit scribere, an velis librum illum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">De pretio nihil sis sollici<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>tus; ego, quantum potero, minimo pretio emam a typographis nostris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName>Constant</placeName> autem isti libelli omnes 8 batziones <placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tuum autem erit <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>scribere, quid domino <persName ref="p4851">Froschovero</persName> pro ternionibus illis dare debeam, idque libens <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>dabo, quodcunque petierit a me.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Desunt autem adhuc quędam in 3. tomo operum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p4091">Zvinglii</persName> Liber proverbium Salomonis iuxta Hebraicam veritatem complanatus, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>complanatio Ecclesiastis, - <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>in Cantica canticorum, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>- libri Iob.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Hiis libellis acceptis nunc integra sanctissimi viri opera habeo, thesaurum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>auro et argento pretiosiore<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>m.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Peto insuper a te, ut de iuramento dando et accipiendo fuse ad me scribas, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>si tantum otii habes, idque ordine, quo omnia tua nobis soles dare.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nos suppli<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>catorium bellum senatui nostro dedimus, ne iurent per sanctos, verba ex scriptura <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>adduximus, rationes et exempla adiunximus; sed nihildum responsi accepimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Valentinus iuramentum adprobat cum senatui nostro et adhuc unus ex fratribus, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>qui ambo se a nobis seiunxerunt.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">nos autem in nomine domini, id quod in scripturis <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>est expressum, negare non potuimus neque negabimus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Pastores nostri certi, cogor <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>id dicere, pessime et amaris verbis exceperunt senatus nostri legatos, qui ad illos <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quatuor pastores missi erant ac dissidentes dimiserunt, pęnitentia postea ducti <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>sunt.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Si in primo congressu legatos bene accepissent seque deliberaturos cum reli<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>quis fratribus esse altera die, certe omnia melius accidissent.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">De qua re nunc <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>non licet multis disserere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ex <placeName ref="l808">Belgis</placeName> nihil habemus certi.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Hoc autem audivi a mercatore <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quodam: "<persName>Caesar</persName></foreign> hat alle botschafften in Probant beschickt, inen fur<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>gehalten, das syn bitt und beger das sey, ouch sein rettliche meyn<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ung, das sy im und den synen sollen <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniam</placeName> helffen schützen <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>und schyrmen wider mencklichen mit volck, probant, geschutz, stein <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>und pulver.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Das sölle im abgeschlagen sin von den stetten; aber <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>sunst wellen sy willig und gehorsam seyn, k[aiserlicher] m[aje]st[at] zu dienen, ouch <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ir vatterland ze beschirmen."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> nondum recepit missam.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Nemo credit, quanto studio <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>audiatur verbum dei et pro concordia orant sedulo publicis in templis <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>absque dubio dominus audiet illorum preces.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 13. iulii 1549.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> salutabis.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Vigilantis<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>simo pastori <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullinge<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ro</persName>, pręceptori suo perpetuo colendo.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
